OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPerhaps some
OL,6,Fearly evening brightness to the east
OL,7,Fof the hills. Otherwise, rather cloudy
OL,8,Fand blustery overnight with occasional
OL,9,Fspots of rain or drizzle in the
OL,10,Fbreeze, mainly over the Moors in the
OL,11,Fwest. Staying mild and turning
OL,12,Fincreasingly humid.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FGenerally cloudy with rain
OL,15,Fand drizzle possible, perhaps quite
OL,16,Fpersistent at times in Devon and
OL,17,FCornwall. Winds gradually easing but
OL,18,Fremaining breezy. Murky in places and
OL,19,Ffeeling fairly muggy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
